        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 65.76,
          "end": 67.8,
          "en": "And to navigate to different controllers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 67.8,
          "end": 69.15,
          "en": "we have our Front controllers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 69.15,
          "end": 71.1,
          "en": "So basically, you have a client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 71.1,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "and then you have a lot of controllers on the other side.",
